change nobody asked for. Git stored two commits whose fifteen hunks interleave all
four, and the colours in that panel are ours, since git holds no record of which
request produced which hunk. \sgt{} stored one edit per changed function, filed
under the request it came from, so the caching is six edits with a name and the one
function three requests all wrote is visible as such.}

